# arm64 hypervisor: KVM has no vendor split here -- CONFIG_KVM in the shared
# layer is the whole selection, running VHE or nVHE per the hardware.
#
# Confidential computing: Arm CCA's host side is not yet complete upstream at
# our floors; when RMM/realm support lands to the standard of SEV-SNP/TDX it
# gets added here.  Nothing to configure today, stated so nobody wonders.
#
# pKVM (protected KVM) is deliberately off: it is an Android posture, not a
# cloud-host one, and it constrains VMM behaviour the CH/FC stack assumes.
